# EF Core precompiled queries (src/BaristaNotes.Core/Data/CompiledModels/*.EFInterceptors.*.cs)
# use [InterceptsLocation] with a checksum of each intercepted source file. Keep those
# sources LF on every OS, or a CRLF checkout (core.autocrlf=true on Windows) changes the
# checksum and the build fails with CS9234.
src/BaristaNotes.Core/**/*.cs text eol=lf
